podman (6.0.2-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Repackaged self-contained build of podman 6.0.2 bundling netavark 2.0.0,
    aardvark-dns 2.0.0, catatonit, rootlessport, quadlet, and the buildah
    CLI.  No external netavark, aardvark-dns, or catatonit package required.
  * Networking via netavark 2.x (nftables-only; iptables support removed).
  * Rootless networking via passt/pasta (slirp4netns removed in podman 6.0).
  * cgroups v2 required at runtime.

